<!--
  简体中文 (Simplified Chinese).

  Deliberately left in English, matching values/strings.xml:
   * 模型名与档位名 — hyperswap, arcface, yoloface_8n, v68/v73/v79/v81. They are identifiers
     that appear in FaceFusion's own documentation, in the manifest and in every bug report;
     translating them leaves the reader with nothing to search for.
   * Units and technical tokens — MB, fps, ms, VTCM, SoC, fp16, GPU, CPU, NPU, Vulkan.
   * 文件名 — never translated anywhere.

  ⚠ gate_blocked and gate_error MUST stay distinguishable. The first is a refusal; the
  second is a fault in our own code, and wording it like a refusal blames the user for it.
-->
